                                                "sense_id": "3447fbe3-4a40-354c-b549-8e58e480fad2",
                                                "text": "Eccles' handshake, eager and practiced and hard, seems to symbolize for him an embrace. For an instant Rabbit fears he will never let go."
                                            }
